1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,200
Animal Sounds with Mimo!

2
00:00:07,107 --> 00:00:13,759
Mimo: Hi friends! It's me, Mimo! Today we're visiting the farm to learn animal sounds!

3
00:00:15,359 --> 00:00:20,895
Mimo: Every animal makes its own special sound. Are you ready to make them with me?

4
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:26,789
Bruno: Animal sounds? I know all of them! I'm a bear. Bears go... ROAR!

5
00:00:29,089 --> 00:00:34,055
Mimo: Great roar, Bruno! Let's see if you know the farm animals.

6
00:00:36,105 --> 00:00:39,116
Mimo: This is a cow! What does the cow say?

7
00:00:41,216 --> 00:00:42,880
Mimo: Moo! Moooo!

8
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,557
Mimo: Can you say moo?

9
00:00:46,457 --> 00:00:48,166
Bruno: Moo! Hey, that's easy!

10
00:00:49,866 --> 00:00:52,942
Mimo: This is a pig! What does the pig say?

11
00:00:54,642 --> 00:00:56,104
Bruno: Um... the pig says... yum yum?

12
00:00:56,404 --> 00:01:00,033
Mimo: No, Bruno! The pig says oink, oink!

13
00:01:00,333 --> 00:01:02,217
Mimo: Can you say oink oink?

14
00:01:05,617 --> 00:01:08,244
Bruno: Oink oink! That's what I say when I see pancakes.

15
00:01:09,865 --> 00:01:13,960
Pip: Hi everybody! Can I help? I'm a bird, so I know the bird sounds!

16
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:18,807
Mimo: This is a duck! What does the duck say?

17
00:01:20,507 --> 00:01:22,193
Pip: Quack, quack, quack!

18
00:01:23,893 --> 00:01:25,395
Mimo: Can you say quack?

19
00:01:28,695 --> 00:01:32,804
Mimo: This fluffy friend is a sheep! What does the sheep say?

20
00:01:34,504 --> 00:01:35,633
Pip: Baa! Baa!

21
00:01:35,933 --> 00:01:38,698
Bruno: The sheep looks like a big cloud with legs!

22
00:01:40,998 --> 00:01:42,447
Mimo: Can you say baa?

23
00:01:45,747 --> 00:01:48,768
Mimo: This is a dog! What does the dog say?

24
00:01:50,468 --> 00:01:51,945
Bruno: Woof! Woof! Bark bark!

25
00:01:52,945 --> 00:01:54,921
Mimo: Can you say woof woof?

26
00:01:57,995 --> 00:02:00,238
Lulu: Hello! Did somebody call for a cat?

27
00:02:00,538 --> 00:02:03,217
Mimo: Lulu! What does the cat say?

28
00:02:04,917 --> 00:02:07,039
Lulu: Meow! Meow! Purrr.

29
00:02:08,839 --> 00:02:10,369
Mimo: Can you say meow?

30
00:02:13,669 --> 00:02:17,038
Mimo: This is a chicken! What does the chicken say?

31
00:02:18,738 --> 00:02:20,888
Pip: Cluck cluck cluck! She's my cousin!

32
00:02:23,188 --> 00:02:25,073
Mimo: Can you say cluck cluck?

33
00:02:28,373 --> 00:02:31,597
Mimo: This is a frog! What does the frog say?

34
00:02:33,297 --> 00:02:34,731
Lulu: Ribbit! Ribbit!

35
00:02:36,024 --> 00:02:38,172
Pip: Ribbit! I'm a hopping frog!

36
00:02:38,472 --> 00:02:40,028
Mimo: Can you say ribbit?

37
00:02:43,328 --> 00:02:48,620
Mimo: And this is the king of the jungle. A lion! What does the lion say?

38
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:51,948
Bruno: ROOOOAR!

39
00:02:53,848 --> 00:02:55,399
Pip: Eek! A lion!

40
00:02:55,699 --> 00:02:58,653
Bruno: It's just me! It's Bruno! I'm a very good lion.

41
00:03:00,953 --> 00:03:03,623
Mimo: Can you roar like a lion? Roar!

42
00:03:07,392 --> 00:03:09,577
Hoot: Hoo! Hoo! Did somebody forget the owl?

43
00:03:10,777 --> 00:03:13,906
Mimo: Grandpa Hoot! What does the owl say?

44
00:03:15,606 --> 00:03:17,606
Hoot: Hoo, hoo! The owl says hoo hoo!

45
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:19,462
Mimo: Can you say hoo hoo?

46
00:03:21,362 --> 00:03:25,845
Mimo: Now let's have an animal sound parade! Say them with us!

47
00:03:26,145 --> 00:03:27,468
Mimo: The cow says...

48
00:03:28,968 --> 00:03:29,377
Bruno: Moo!

49
00:03:29,677 --> 00:03:31,002
Mimo: The pig says...

50
00:03:32,502 --> 00:03:33,315
Bruno: Oink oink!

51
00:03:33,615 --> 00:03:34,854
Mimo: The duck says...

52
00:03:36,354 --> 00:03:37,517
Pip: Quack quack!

53
00:03:37,817 --> 00:03:39,191
Mimo: The sheep says...

54
00:03:40,691 --> 00:03:41,358
Lulu: Baa!

55
00:03:41,658 --> 00:03:43,090
Mimo: The dog says...

56
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:45,800
Bruno: Woof woof!

57
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:47,771
Mimo: And the lion says...

58
00:03:49,271 --> 00:03:49,738
Bruno: ROAR!

59
00:03:50,038 --> 00:03:54,276
Mimo: Great job, friends! You know all the animal sounds!

60
00:03:55,876 --> 00:03:58,085
Bruno: Mimo, what sound does a bunny make?

61
00:04:00,385 --> 00:04:05,637
Mimo: Hmm. Bunnies are very quiet. We just go... munch, munch, munch!

62
00:04:09,537 --> 00:04:14,403
Mimo: Next time, let's learn opposites! Bye bye, friends!
